---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Terms of Use" description="Beyond Panama Relocation terms of use — informational content, no legal advice, honest orientation." lang="en">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <a href="/en/" class="text-jade text-sm hover:underline">← Home</a>
    <header class="mt-4 mb-10">
      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl text-slate mb-2">Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-mid text-sm">Last updated: September 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none space-y-8 text-slate-mid leading-relaxed">

      <p>Welcome to Beyond Panama Relocation. By using this website you agree to the following terms. If you disagree, please don't use the site — though we think you'll find them fair.</p>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-3">1. What Beyond Panama is — and isn't</h2>
        <p class="text-sm">Beyond Panama Relocation is an independent informational resource for people considering a move to Panama. We are <strong class="text-slate">not</strong> a law firm, an immigration attorney, a real estate agency, or a financial advisor. Nothing on this site constitutes legal, immigration, tax, or financial advice.</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm">Think of us as a well-informed friend who has already navigated the process — we share what we know honestly, but for anything that has legal or financial consequences, you should always consult a licensed professional.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-3">2. Accuracy of information</h2>
        <p class="text-sm">We work hard to keep our content accurate and up to date, but immigration rules, visa requirements, real estate regulations, and cost-of-living figures change. We do not guarantee that any information on this site is current, complete, or applicable to your specific situation. Always verify with a qualified professional before starting any process.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-3">3. No guarantees of results</h2>
        <p class="text-sm">Beyond Panama does not guarantee any outcome in immigration, visa approval, property purchase, or any other process. Outcomes depend on individual circumstances, legal professionals, and government decisions outside our control.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-3">4. Third-party professionals</h2>
        <p class="text-sm">If you request a referral to a lawyer, real estate agent, or other professional, that relationship is between you and the professional. Beyond Panama is not a party to that contract, is not responsible for the services provided, and does not supervise the professional's work. We only refer professionals we would personally recommend, but the outcome of your engagement with them is yours.</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm">Beyond Panama may receive a referral fee from the professional at no cost to you. This does not influence which professionals we recommend.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-3">5. Use of this site</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li>This site is for personal, non-commercial use.</li>
          <li>You may share links to any page freely.</li>
          <li>You may not reproduce or republish full articles, guides, or tools without written authorization.</li>
          <li>You may not use automated tools to scrape or index this site's content at scale.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-3">6. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p class="text-sm">All original content on Beyond Panama Relocation — text, graphics, tools, and structure — is protected by copyright. Brief quotes with attribution are welcome. Full reproduction requires permission.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-3">7. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p class="text-sm">To the fullest extent permitted by law, Beyond Panama Relocation is not liable for any direct, indirect, or consequential loss arising from your use of this site or reliance on its content. Use this site as one source among many, and make decisions with qualified professional guidance.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-3">8. Changes to these terms</h2>
        <p class="text-sm">We may update these terms at any time. Continued use of the site after changes constitutes acceptance.</p>
      </div>

      <p class="text-sm">Questions? Use our <a href="/en/contact" class="text-jade hover:underline">contact form</a>.</p>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
